      "question": "What is the fastest way when learning how to check pc specs on Windows 11?",
      "answer": "The fastest native method is pressing Ctrl + Shift + Esc to open Task Manager and selecting the Performance tab. This displays live clock rates for your processor, memory channel speed in MegaTransfers per second (MT/s), active disk read/write throughput, and dedicated GPU video RAM (VRAM) without requiring third-party software."
